6 12\"><use href=\"#flag-ru\"></use></svg>RU</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"uk\" href=\"/uk/contact/\" hreflang=\"uk\" lang=\"uk\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-ua\"></use></svg>UK</a>\n<a aria-current=\"false\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"es\" href=\"/es/contact/\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-es\"></use></svg>ES</a>\n<a aria-current=\"true\" class=\"menu__lang\" data-lang=\"cs\" href=\"/cs/contact/\" hreflang=\"cs\" lang=\"cs\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flag\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 12\"><use href=\"#flag-cz\"></use></svg>CS</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"menu__contact\">\n<span class=\"mono\">Obecné dotazy</span>\n<a href=\"mailto:hello@ironvane-media.com\">hello@ironvane-media.com</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div aria-labelledby=\"read-bar-label\" class=\"read-bar\" data-read-bar=\"\" hidden=\"\"><i></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\" id=\"read-bar-label\">Průběh čtení</span></div>", "main": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Drobečková navigace\" class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"/cs/\">Úvod</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Kontakt</span></nav>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Kontakt</p>\n<h1 class=\"page-hero__title balance\">Napište nám, s jakou metrikou je potřeba pohnout.</h1>\n<p class=\"page-hero__lead lead pretty\">Čím konkrétněji popíšete produkt, trh a omezení, tím užitečnější bude naše první odpověď. Odpovídáme do 24 hodin od doručení zprávy.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section--flush-top\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"contact-layout\">\n<div data-reveal=\"\">\n<div class=\"info-list\">\n<div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-row__key\">Obecné dotazy</span><span class=\"info-row__val\"><a href=\"mailto:hello@ironvane-media.com\">hello@ironvane-media.com</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-row__key\">Kariéra</span><span class=\"info-row__val\"><a href=\"mailto:careers@ironvane-media.com\">careers@ironvane-media.com</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-row__key\">Telegram</span><span class=\"info-row__val\"><a href=\"https://t.me/ironvane\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@ironvane</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-row__key\">Doba odezvy</span><span class=\"info-row__val\">Do 24 hodin</span></div>\n<div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-row__key\">Pracujeme v jazycích</span><span class=\"info-row__val\">angličtina, ruština, ukrajinština, španělština, čeština, němčina, polština, portugalština, turečtina</span></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-top:52px\">Co bude dál</h2>\n<div class=\"expect\"><div class=\"expect__item\"><span class=\"expect__num\">01</span><div><h3 class=\"expect__title\">Přečteme to pořádně</h3><p class=\"expect__text\">Vaši zprávu čte senior člověk, ne formulářový router. Pokud se nehodíme, řekneme to rovnou a poradíme, kam se obrátit.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"expect__item\"><span class=\"expect__num\">02</span><div><h3 class=\"expect__title\">Třicetiminutový hovor</h3><p class=\"expect__text\">Produkt, trh, současná ekonomika a co už jste zkoušeli. Bez prezentací a bez rituálního discovery.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"expect__item\"><span class=\"expect__num\">03</span><div><h3 class=\"expect__title\">Písemné vyhodnocení</h3><p class=\"expect__text\">Během několika dní dostanete naše poctivé posouzení: kde je příležitost, co by to vyžadovalo a čeho bychom se nedotýkali.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-wrap\" data-reveal=\"\">\n<form action=\"/api/lead\" class=\"form\" data-endpoint=\"/api/lead\" data-form=\"\" data-mailto=\"hello@ironvane-media.com\" method=\"post\" novalidate=\"\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hp\"><label>Website<input autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\"/></label></div>\n<p class=\"form__title\">Poptávka projektu</p>\n<div aria-label=\"Firma / Jednotlivec\" class=\"form__mode\" role=\"group\">\n<button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"mode is-active\" data-mode=\"company\" type=\"button\">Firma</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"mode\" data-mode=\"person\" type=\"button\">Jednotlivec</button>\n</div>\n<input name=\"mode\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"company\"/>\n<div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\"><label class=\"field__label\" for=\"contact-name\">Jméno</label><input aria-describedby=\"contact-name-err\" autocomplete=\"name\" id=\"contact-name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Vaše jméno\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><span class=\"field__error\" id=\"contact-name-err\">Povinné pole</span></div>\n<div class=\"field\"><label class=\"field__label\" for=\"contact-email\">E-mail</label><input aria-describedby=\"contact-email-err\" autocomplete=\"email\" id=\"contact-email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"vy@firma.cz\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/><span class=\"field__error\" id=\"contact-email-err\">Zadejte platný e-mail</span></div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-when=\"company\"><label class=\"field__label\" for=\"contact-company\">Společnost</label><input aria-describedby=\"contact-company-err\" autocomplete=\"organization\" id=\"contact-company\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"Název společnosti\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><span class=\"field__error\" id=\"contact-company-err\">Povinné pole</span></div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-when=\"company\"><label class=\"field__label\" for=\"contact-country\">Země nebo trh</label><input aria-describedby=\"contact-country-err\" autocomplete=\"country-name\" id=\"contact-country\" name=\"country\" placeholder=\"Kde působíte\" required=\"\" type=\"text\"/><span class=\"field__error\" id=\"contact-country-err\">Povinné pole</span></div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-when=\"company\">